          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "要するに、ChatGPTの弟分だろ?",
          "en": "So basically, ChatGPT's little brother?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "答えの出し方が、まるで違うの!",
          "en": "It gets its answers a totally different way!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ChatGPTは、一文字ずつ順番に書く",
          "en": "ChatGPT writes word by word, in order."
