        {
          "id": "p8-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "小僧、今夜は泊まりだ!!",
          "en": "Kid, we're pulling an all-nighter!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "僕、十六です",
          "en": "I'm sixteen."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-1-3",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "十八歳未満の深夜業は、法律で禁止!",
          "en": "Late-night work under 18 is against the law!",
          "note": "Same law as before: Japan's Labor Standards Act bars anyone under 18 from working between 10 p.m. and 5 a.m."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-1-4",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "お疲れさまでした",
          "en": "See you tomorrow."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "AIそのものを作るのは……げ、、、、できそうにない。",
          "en": "Building an AI from scratch... ugh... not happening."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "おっ、ネットで、無料で公開されているAIもあるのか。",
          "en": "Oh? Some AIs are posted online for free?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ソフトなら、コピーするだけならタダだ……これを使わない手はない。",
          "en": "Copying software costs nothing... I'd be a fool not to use it."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "AIは次の一文字を、確率で選んでるだけか",
          "en": "So AI just picks the next word by probability."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-5-2",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "なら『は』の93％が、答えの自信そのものだ",
          "en": "Then that 93% on “Yes” IS its confidence!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-6-1",
          "panel": 6,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "喋らせるから高えんだ。一文字目だけだ!!",
          "en": "Talking is what costs. Just the first word!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-6-2",
          "panel": 6,
          "type": "caption",
          "ja": "テツの悪知恵。AIに最後まで喋らせず、一文字目だけを出させる。『は』が出れば『はい』。それで答えは足りる。出力を絞った分、返事は速く、料金も安い。",
          "en": "Tetsu's dirty trick: don't let the AI finish. Read only its first word — if it starts with “Yes,” the answer is yes. Less output means faster replies and a smaller bill."
        }
      ]
    },
